"links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23608166/files/replication_package_msr.zip/content"}}], "swh": null, "owners": [{"id": "1710405"}], "status": "published", "stats": {"downloads": 1, "unique_downloads": 1, "views": 6, "unique_views": 6, "version_downloads": 1, "version_unique_downloads": 1, "version_unique_views": 6, "version_views": 6}, "state": "done", "submitted": true}, {"created": "2026-10-24T00:53:08.644336+00:00", "modified": "2026-10-24T00:53:08.926281+00:00", "id": 23381101, "conceptrecid": "23381100", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23381101", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.23381100", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23381101", "metadata": {"title": "Replication package for: Not all innovation counts the same: which activities go with SME competitiveness in 12 Ibero-American countries", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.23381101", "publication_date": "2026-10-23", "description": "<p>Replication package for the article \"Not all innovation counts the same: which activities go with SME competitiveness in 12 Ibero-American countries\" (FaedPyme IberoAmerica 2024; estimation sample of 7,332 small and medium-sized enterprises from 12 countries after removing duplicated and careless questionnaires).</p>\n<p>The package contains the scripts that build the analysis file from the FaedPyme microdata and document the cleaning of the base (01_datos.py, depuracion/), estimate every model of the article with country, sector and size fixed effects (02_modelos.py), the measurement analysis in R (03_medida.R: tetrachoric matrix, parallel analysis, confirmatory factor models with admissibility checks, Schmid-Leiman omega), the figures (04_figuras.py), inference clustered by country with restricted and unrestricted wild cluster bootstrap and CR2 variances (08, 10, 12 and 13), the sensitivity to the cleaning of the base (09), the cluster analysis of countries (11), every output table and figure reported in the article (salidas/), and a synthetic dataset that reproduces the means and covariance matrix of the analysis variables so that every OLS coefficient can be re-run without the microdata. The FaedPyme microdata are held by the FaedPyme network and are not redistributed; the scripts document exactly how the analysis file is built from them.</p>\n<p>Requirements: Python 3.11 with pandas, numpy, statsmodels, scipy, matplotlib, pyreadstat; R 4.5 with lavaan, psych, GPArotation, jsonlite.</p>\n<p>Version 2.0.0 supersedes 1.0.0, which accompanied an earlier draft without country identifiers.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Restrepo-Morales, Jorge A.", "affiliation": "Universidad Autonoma del Peru", "orcid": "0000-0001-9764-6622"}, {"name": "Rodriguez Flores, Eduar Antonio", "affiliation": "Universidad Autonoma del Peru", "orcid": "0000-0003-0807-6686"}, {"name": "Giraldo Betancur, Emerson Andres", "affiliation": "Tecnologico de Antioquia, Institucion Universitaria", "orcid": "0000-0002-1779-1262"}, {"name": "Zea Restrepo, Freddy", "affiliation": "Tecnologico de Antioquia, Institucion Universitaria", "orcid": "0009-0005-1882-8433"}], "keywords": ["innovation activities", "SME competitiveness", "Oslo Manual", "business obstacles", "equivalence testing", "wild cluster bootstrap", "Ibero-America", "FaedPyme", "replication package"], "version": "2.0.0", "language": "eng", "resource_type": {"title": "Software", "type": "software"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 0, "is_last": true, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "23381100"}}]}}, "title": "Replication package for: Not all innovation counts the same: which activities go with SME competitiveness in 12 Ibero-American countries", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/23381101", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23381101", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/23381101?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23381101", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23381101", "self_doi_html": 